  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NATURS Marine Initiativ07</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NATURs Marine Initiativ07 - Databas FAO Safety at Sea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Elaboration &amp; publication of ca. 10 fact sheets in Swedish on Sidas external website/public. database of school material about oceans and coasts for 4th-6th grade, 7th-8th grade, and high school (10th-12th grade).2) Consultant assignment for elab. of proposal for national database in dev. conutries for registration of accidents at sea for small scale fishery in dev. countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">p&#xe5; svenska 1) Utarbetande och publicering av ca 10 st faktablad p&#xe5; Sidas externa hemsida/piblikationsdatabas av skolmaterial om hav och kust f&#xf6;r mellanstadium, h&#xf6;gstadium samt gymnasium. 2) Konsultuppdrag f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till FAo utarbeta f&#xf6;rslag till m&#xf6;jlig utformning av natinella databaser f&#xf6;r reg. av sj&#xf6;olyckor f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5;skaligt fiske i utveckingsl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
  </description>
